{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"tool_calls","index":0,"message":{"content":"Let me reconsider the puzzle. The International Booker Prize was established in 2005 (2000s). Let me think about the structure:\n- Book A: contender for the award, translated into 25+ languages, published in the 2010s\n- Book B: won the award, released the year before Book A was published (in the 2010s)\n- Author of B born in the city where author of A grew up\n\nLet me look at the International Booker Prize winners list. The 2016 winner was The Vegetarian (Han Kang). Let me check the Wikipedia page for the International Booker Prize to get the full winners list.","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"International Booker Prize Wikipedia\", \"Man Booker International Prize Wikipedia winners list\"], \"top_k\": 5}","name":"search"},"id":"call_9387625687ec4cd0954e78ae","index":0,"type":"function"},{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"The Vegetarian Han Kang translated into languages number\", \"Han Kang born city Gwangju biography\", \"The Vegetarian published 2015 2016 English translation\"], \"top_k\": 8}","name":"search"},"id":"call_52d9c0ef6b804d5290964538","index":1,"type":"function"}]}}],"created":1789471019,"id":"chatcmpl-da25f365-ee9a-9e3e-8868-dd084ff8085d","model":"glm-5.2","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"prompt_tokens":19815,"completion_tokens":213,"reasoning_tokens":0,"total_tokens":20028,"cached_tokens":3328,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":3328},"prompt_cost":0.000000,"completion_cost":0.000000,"cache_cost":0.000000}}